diff --git a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
index 2de79e6b5..2ccbddffd 100644
--- a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
+++ b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
@@ -358,7 +358,7 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5522+) New **Policy Advisor**. **Beautified**: enlarge **top panels text** so **long civic names don't overflow**. **Remove multiline nationality** information which was **uninfomative** and **crowded vertically** in the **Religions tab** and the **Corporations tab**; use more precise and compact `Leader (ID)` and `HQ (ID)` **one-liner instead** (**ID** also handles **one leader name being used by several players**); **increase row spacing** (now **unified** (was crowded)). **Remove multiline wrapped bonuses** splitting logic in the **Corporations tab**: use one natural comma-separated line (bonuses row height reduced/standardized) since there is enough space after expanding the Policy Advisor and it is more readable. Also add **new rows** (**Bonuses Generated**, **Yields Generated**), and add **first column descriptions** for rows (as of now `Built By:`, `Consumes:`, `Generates:`, `Generates 2:`). Add a **Great Person icon** in `Built By:` row. Change in [CvPolicyAdvisorScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvPolicyAdvisorScreen.py).
 - **Foreign Advisor**: refined its tabs so they can display **up to 12 players**. Notably renamed the Active tab to **Treaties** tab (no longer shows redundant bonuses (since their deal can be cancelled from the bonuses tab)), and **beautified** it with **icons**. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5516+) Always use the unified **table-style info layout** (`drawInfoImproved`) for the Info Tab for stable column behavior: the old hardcoded text spacing (`drawInfoOriginal`) did not **scale with upscaled font text** nor **adjust depending on advisor screen size**. Plus the improved layout has additional **information** like general or specific **colored leader attitude text** related to civic/religion choices (e.g., `[-2]` or `[+1]`). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5518+) **Beautified** the **Espionage Tab** similarly; notably **removed redundant Espionage slider** now that commerce sliders are on the right side of main interface in map view, and **improved text spacing** that **was colliding or overflowing** beyond its panel, and **moved + - buttons under the leader icon** where there is more room and it is more intuitive and easier to click it.
 - Added **"Willing to become vassal"** and **"Vassal"** **icons** in the Foreign Advisor's Glance tab in the human player's row, to help avoid the need to tediously check these up through other screens, in [CvForeignAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvForeignAdvisor.py), and in [CvDLLWidgetData.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDLLWidgetData.cpp) for the corresponding **tooltip** (on hover). See ["Willing to become a vassal" and "vassal" icons](/README.md#willing-to-become-a-vassal-and-vassal-icons-in-foreign-advisors-glance-tab).
-- Reworked the **Military Advisor** in [CvMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMilitaryAdvisor.py) now with Unit Combat and Units **icons**. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5530+) Note: **icon size** is **increased** at **higher resolutions** (e.g., from 24 to 32 if resolution height >= 1440). Note 2: as of now the [CvBUGMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvBUGMilitaryAdvisor.py) is not supported.  See also [KI#123](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#123---fixed-bug-domesticmilitary-advisor-variant-toggles-required-restarting-civ4).
+- Reworked the **Military Advisor** in [CvMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMilitaryAdvisor.py) now with Unit Combat and Units **icons**. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5530+) Note: **unit icon size** is **increased** at **higher resolutions** (e.g., from 24 to 32 if resolution height >= 1440). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5777+) **Lift up the unit panel to full height** (reduces the need for scrolling vertically), and use the space gained from expanding the advisor to **increase leader icon bar from 1 to 2 rows**, and **do not halve icon size until both rows are full**. For example, this allows **at 1080p to show up to 24 players** (including barbarian) at **full leader icon size** before leader icon size is halved, which should now cover most games. Note 2: as of now the [CvBUGMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvBUGMilitaryAdvisor.py) is not supported.  See also [KI#123](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#123---fixed-bug-domesticmilitary-advisor-variant-toggles-required-restarting-civ4).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5771+) Added a new **Battles tab** in the Military Advisor, showing as a **sortable table** the detailed **record of each battle** for the selected player in debug dropdown (or the active player or its vassals outside debug mode): **Turn**, **Year**, **Result** (Won, Lost, Retreat) as emoji, **Estimated Odds %** (simple starting effective strength comparison, not exact Civ4 combat odds), **Role** (Are we the attacker?) as emoji, **base Strength** (XML), **start effective Strength** (including modifiers at that battle), **end effective Strength**, **max effective Strength**, **XP before combat** (yellow if Great-General-led), **Our Unit**, **Their Unit** (unit name in yellow if Great-General-led), **same** strength/XP columns for their unit, **Civ icon**, **Player icon**, **Player ID** (to cover the same leader picked by several leaders (custom games, etc.)), **Captured Unit type**, **Captured Unit icon**, **Hill or Peak icon**, **Terrain icon**, **Feature icon**, **Click Plot icon** (**on click camera is moved to this plot** (as the wonder tabs' (Info Screen) text does), with distinct art for normal plot, defended city, and captured city battles). Icons are **hoverable to sevopedia** (or have a camera effect). **Text color** is added for Result (Won: green; Lost: red; Retreat: yellow), effective Strength (white: 100%, green: > 66%, yellow: > 33%; red <= 33%), and captured units (we gained a unit amount: green; we lost a unit amout: red). Implemented a **legend link**, and **LOG Button** (as the Timeline tab). Examples of LOG: `163 | 760 AD | Lost | 43 | A | 6 | 6.04 |  | 7.20 | 8 | 0 | Camel Archer | Longbowman | 5 | 0 | 4 | 8.10 | 5.04 | 9.00 | 9 | 0 |  |  | TERRAIN_GRASS |  | 54 | 30`, `133 | 10 BC | Won | 64 | A | 3 | 3.30 | 1.81 | 3.30 | 2 | 0 | Trireme | Galley | 1 | 0 | 2 | 1.84 |  | 2.20 | 48 | 0 |  |  | TERRAIN_COAST |  | 32 | 10`. Main files changed: [CvMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMilitaryAdvisor.py), [SASBattleHistory.py](/Assets/Python/SASBattleHistory.py), [CvEventManager.py](/Assets/Python/CvEventManager.py), [BugEventManager.py](/Assets/Python/BUG/BugEventManager.py), [CvUnit.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvUnit.cpp), [CvDllPythonEvents.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDllPythonEvents.cpp), [CvDllPythonEvents.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDllPythonEvents.h), [CvEventReporter.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEventReporter.cpp), [CvEventReporter.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEventReporter.h).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5775+) Added a new **Composition Tab**, as a set of **sortable tables** for **Current** (unlike saved data in the Statistics Tab in the Info Screen) **Units** (non-civilian, including Animal (including Barbarian in debug mode)), **Promotions**, and **Unit Combats** **counts**, default-**sorted from most to least** for no tedium (as done in the Statistics Tab). See also [KI#129](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#129---fixed-military-advisor-units-tab-minimap-disappeared-after-switching-tabs).
 - Similarly Beautified and Enhanced the **Technology Advisor** in [CvTechChooser.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvTechChooser.py) so it uses more of the screen while still preserving key information. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5519+) Players can **optionally** set an **alternative lower right space for scoreboard** on **lower game resolutions** (e.g., 1920*1080) so that an **extra column or more is visible** in the technology advisor, and an **alternative top space space** for **advisor buttons** (in map view) because this alternative right space may cover these advisor buttons. **Boldened title** for consistency. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5520+) See also [KI#114](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#114---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-tech-advisor-on-save-load-initially-shown-current-tech-missing-turns-left-timer-until-another-tech-is-clicked). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5691+) **When opening** Technology Advisor, **right-align scoreboard leader text** so it is easier to read (because text is often not visible due to advisor width expansion). **On Technology Advisor close**, it **reverts back** to usual alignment.

